="00:28.839" end="00:29.605">you </span><span begin="00:29.605" end="00:30.093">to </span><span begin="00:30.093" end="00:31.486">hear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.555" end="00:39.581"><span begin="00:31.555" end="00:32.078">These </span><span begin="00:32.078" end="00:32.914">shapes </span><span begin="00:32.914" end="00:33.576">and </span><span begin="00:33.576" end="00:35.143">colors </span><span begin="00:35.143" end="00:36.815">overwhelm </span><span begin="00:36.815" end="00:37.581">my </span><span begin="00:37.581" end="00:39.581">vision</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.054" end="00:43.586"><span begin="00:40.054" end="00:41.586">Losing </span><span begin="00:41.586" end="00:43.586">power</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.696" end="02:26.126"><span begin="00:45.696" end="00:46.637">Oh </span><span begin="00:46.637" end="01:28.433">I'm </span><span begin="01:28.433" end="02:24.126">losing </span><span begin="02:24.126" end="02:26.126">power</span></p></div></body></tt>